SharpPack
=========

SharpPack is an independently maintained internal fork derived from MemoryPack,
originally developed by Cysharp, Inc.

The original MemoryPack source and this derivative are licensed under the MIT
License. The original Cysharp copyright notice is retained in LICENSE.

SharpPack preserves the MemoryPack binary wire format as a compatibility
contract while exposing a renamed SharpPack API and package identity.
